      "level": 1,
      "topic": "archive fashion",
      "title_zh": "一个老包",
      "title_en": "A vintage bag",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["我", "在", "闲鱼", "上", "看到", "了", "一", "个", "老", "包", "。", "我", "一", "看", "就", "很", "喜欢", "。"],
        ["这", "个", "包", "是", "二十", "年", "前", "的", "，", "还", "很", "新", "。", "我", "很", "想", "要", "。"],
        ["我", "问", "：", "“", "多少", "钱", "？", "”", "他", "说", "：", "“", "五百", "元", "。", "”"],
        ["我", "说", "：", "“", "五百", "太", "多", "了", "，", "四百", "行", "吗", "？", "”", "他", "想", "了", "想", "，", "说", "：", "“", "行", "吧", "。", "”"],
        ["今天", "，", "包", "到", "了", "。", "我", "真", "喜欢", "！", "我", "明天", "就", "要", "用", "。", "朋友", "们", "都", "说", "很", "好", "。"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "I saw an old bag on Xianyu. I liked it as soon as I saw it.",
        "The bag is twenty years old, but it still looks new. I really wanted it.",
        "I asked: “How much?” He said: “500 yuan.”",
        "I said: “500 is too much. Would 400 be OK?” He thought for a moment and said: “Fine.”",
        "Today the bag arrived. I really love it! I’m going to use it tomorrow. My friends all say it’s great."
      ],
      "names": ["闲鱼"],
      "new_words": ["包", "元"],
      "glossary": [
        { "word": "包", "english": "bag" },
        { "word": "元", "english": "yuan (money)" },
        { "word": "闲鱼", "english": "Xianyu (second-hand marketplace app)" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-08-s2",
      "level": 1,
      "topic": "anime",
      "title_zh": "电影里的歌",
      "title_en": "Songs from films",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["我", "喜欢", "听", "日本", "的", "歌", "。", "很", "多", "都", "是", "电影", "里", "的", "。"],
        ["我", "最", "喜欢", "《", "千与千寻", "》", "里", "的", "歌", "。", "我", "一", "天", "能", "听", "很", "多", "次", "。"],
        ["晚上", "，", "我", "在", "家", "听", "歌", "，", "一", "听", "就", "是", "两", "个", "半", "小时", "。"],
        ["歌", "里", "说", "什么", "，", "我", "不", "知道", "。", "我", "还是", "很", "喜欢", "！"],
        ["朋友", "问", "我", "：", "“", "你", "在", "哪里", "听", "的", "？", "”", "我", "说", "：", "“", "我", "告诉", "你", "！", "我们", "一起", "听", "吧", "！", "”"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "I like listening to Japanese songs. Lots of them are from films.",
        "My favourite is the song from Spirited Away. I can listen to it lots of times a day.",
        "In the evening I listen to songs at home — once I start, it's two and a half hours.",
        "I don't know what the songs are saying. I still really like them!",
        "My friend asked me: “Where did you listen to them?” I said: “I’ll tell you! Let’s listen together!”"
      ],
      "names": ["日本", "千与千寻"],
      "new_words": ["歌", "半", "哪里"],
      "glossary": [
        { "word": "歌", "english": "song" },
        { "word": "半", "english": "half" },
        { "word": "哪里", "english": "where" },
        { "word": "日本", "english": "Japan" },
        { "word": "千与千寻", "english": "Spirited Away (Studio Ghibli film)" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "missions": [
    {
      "id": "2026-10-08-m1",
      "level": 1,
      "title": "Finding a friend's flat",
      "role": "保安",
      "goal": "Tell the security guard who you're visiting, which building and floor, and find the lift.",
      "new_words": [
        { "word": "楼", "english": "building; floor" },
        { "word": "哪里", "english": "where" }
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "partner_zh": "你好，你找谁？",
          "partner_en": "Hello, who are you looking for?",
          "prompt_en": "Say you're here to see your friend Xiao Li.",
          "answers_zh": ["我找我朋友小李。", "我来找小李。"],
          "answers_en": ["I'm looking for my friend Xiao Li.", "I'm here to see Xiao Li."]
        },
        {
          "partner_zh": "他住哪个楼？",
          "partner_en": "Which building does he live in?",
          "prompt_en": "Say Building 2.",
          "answers_zh": ["二号楼。", "他住二号楼。"],
          "answers_en": ["Building 2.", "He lives in Building 2."]
        },
        {
          "partner_zh": "二号楼在那边。几楼？",
          "partner_en": "Building 2 is over there. Which floor?",
          "prompt_en": "Say the 5th floor, flat 502.",
          "answers_zh": ["五楼，五零二。", "他住五楼五零二。"],
          "answers_en": ["5th floor, 502.", "He lives on the 5th floor, 502."]
        },
        {
          "partner_zh": "好的。你往前走，左边就是。",
          "partner_en": "OK. Go straight ahead, it's on the left.",
          "prompt_en": "Ask where the lift is.",
          "answers_zh": ["电梯在哪里？", "请问，电梯在哪里？"],
          "answers_en": ["Where's the lift?", "Excuse me, where's the lift?"]
        },
        {
          "partner_zh": "电梯就在门口。",
          "partner_en": "The lift is right by the entrance.",
          "prompt_en": "Say thank you.",
          "answers_zh": ["谢谢你！", "好的，谢谢！"],
          "answers_en": ["Thank you!", "OK, thanks!"]
        }
      ],
      "closing_zh": "不客气。",
      "closing_en": "You're welcome."
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-08-m2",
      "level": 1,
      "title": "Planning a karaoke night",
      "role": "朋友",
      "goal": "Agree on a time for karaoke and talk about which Chinese songs you like.",
      "new_words": [
        { "word": "歌", "english": "song" },
        { "word": "半", "english": "half" },
        { "word": "中国", "english": "China" }
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "partner_zh": "今天晚上去唱歌吧！",
          "partner_en": "Let's go to karaoke tonight!",
          "prompt_en": "Say great, and ask what time.",
          "answers_zh": ["好啊，几点？", "太好了！几点去？"],
          "answers_en": ["Sure, what time?", "Great! What time shall we go?"]
        },
        {
          "partner_zh": "八点半，好吗？",
          "partner_en": "Half past eight, OK?",
          "prompt_en": "Say half past eight is fine.",
          "answers_zh": ["八点半可以。", "好，八点半见。"],
          "answers_en": ["Half past eight works.", "OK, see you at half past eight."]
        },
        {
          "partner_zh": "你会唱中国歌吗？",
          "partner_en": "Can you sing any Chinese songs?",
          "prompt_en": "Say you can sing a little.",
          "answers_zh": ["会一点儿。", "我会唱一点儿。"],
          "answers_en": ["A little.", "I can sing a little."]
        },
        {
          "partner_zh": "你最喜欢哪首歌？",
          "partner_en": "Which song do you like best?",
          "prompt_en": "Say you like “The Moon Represents My Heart”.",
          "answers_zh": ["我喜欢《月亮代表我的心》。", "《月亮代表我的心》！"],
          "answers_en": ["I like “The Moon Represents My Heart”.", "“The Moon Represents My Heart”!"]
        },
        {
          "partner_zh": "我也喜欢！我们一起唱吧。",
          "partner_en": "Me too! Let's sing it together.",
          "prompt_en": "Say OK, see you tonight.",
          "answers_zh": ["好，晚上见！", "好的，晚上见！"],
          "answers_en": ["OK, see you tonight!", "Great, see you tonight!"]
        }
      ],
      "closing_zh": "晚上见！",
      "closing_en": "See you tonight!"
    }
  ]
